# Downloaded crate sources, read for reference only.
/.crates/
# Build outputs copied here by build.ps1.
/spike.exe
/tests/
/target/
/spike-*.exe
# Generated by hand for the large-file shot (1 MB).
/results/big.md
# The app's --frames counters, rewritten every second during a run.
/results/*-frames.json
# The base-vsync worktree build.ps1 -Base builds from, and its tests.
/.wt/
/tests-base/
# Copies of the exes a soak runs, so a rebuild never touches a running one.
/.soak/
